  "description": "The bid response carries the identifier **response\u201112345** and references the client\u2011side session token **session=abc123**. The transaction is settled in **USD** and the overall response is tagged with the bid\u2011response ID **bidresponse\u2011987**. One seat bid is included, originating from seat **seat\u20111** and flagged as a non\u2011grouped entry (group\u202f=\u202f0).  \n\nWithin this seat bid a single creative is offered: the bid is labeled **bid\u2011001** for impression **imp\u2011789** and is priced at **1.23** units. The creative is linked to ad **ad\u2011456**, campaign **campaign\u2011321**, and creative ID **creative\u2011654**. The advertiser\u2019s domain is **advertiser.com**, and a preview image can be retrieved from **https://example.com/preview.jpg**. Win notifications should be sent to **https://example.com/winnotice?bid=bid\u2011001**, while the ad markup to be rendered is **<script>/* ad markup */</script>**. The creative carries attribute codes **1** and **2**."
